ClipNest

 Website: Open ClipNest

ClipNest is a mobile-friendly web application for processing supported YouTube media into MP4 video or MP3 audio, subject to applicable copyright law, platform terms, and the user's rights.

Features

- Mobile-first web interface
- YouTube URL validation
- MP4 and MP3 conversion options
- Background conversion queue
- Progress updates using Server-Sent Events
- Temporary file cleanup
- Docker-based deployment configuration

